Read Steam's files now and list what was found (changes nothing)

Usage: easyplay steam scan [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json        Machine-readable output
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
